<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>首次合照与项目愿景</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>01 · Team</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 497, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}><Box style={{ width: 640, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 620, height: 400, border: '2px dashed #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>团队首次合照</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 18 }}>此处放团队首次合照</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 8 }}>（待补：团队首次线下合照）</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 480, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>团队项目愿景</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 2 }}>未来期望 · 非 V1.5.0 已实现能力</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.6, margin: 0, marginTop: 20 }}>我们希望 AI 校园学习陪伴助手，能真正服务在校学生的课程复习场景。不做泛化闲聊，而是贴合课堂课件、作业错题，提供引导式学习辅助。未来期望优化长文档记忆与多用户能力，让它成为轻量化、易部署的课堂学习工具，帮助同学理清薄弱知识点，形成完整复习闭环。</Text><Box style={{ width: 470, height: 52, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 14, marginTop: 24 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>不做泛化闲聊  ·  形成复习闭环</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>07 / 28</Text></Box></Slide>